sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Source S03
  participant P1 as Evidence S04
  participant P2 as Objectives S05
  participant P3 as Topology S06
  participant P4 as Assessment S07
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Submit observation with source time
    P1->>P1: 2 Verify bytes and qualify under exact policy
    P1->>P4: 3 Publish qualified observation trigger
    P4->>P2: 4 Read current approved target set
    P4->>P3: 5 Read exact accepted graph receipt
    P4->>P4: 6 Reverify required artifacts and seal case
    P4->>P4: 7 Compare exact measurements and targets
    P4->>P4: 8 Retain findings and advisory recommendations
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P4: Late arrival cannot refresh old measurements. Missing or stale input remains Unknown; a risk classifier is not a forecast.
  end
